{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/extras/d6c94151bbd2005dc823bba06494a956.avif?t=1772533047\" width=610 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUKKE is a music tool for everyone, whether you're a music wiz or a complete novice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loop machine is kinda like the old keyboard in your grandparents' basement: go ham, strum around a bit, see what you can put together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, maybe you're a natural! And if you're not, it's a fun ride anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/extras/9d895716166356c0b43f2bc1c0e2f775.avif?t=1772533047\" width=610 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mukke City, Potti district, 1978.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a year in obscurity, Micky Zander returns to the city and tries to find his feet again. He is determined to finally produce an EP. Within the four walls of his small Plattenbau flat, he cooks up some mean beats and does his best not to get distracted by the temptation of a nighttime club crawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the weird little guy who sometimes drops by and talks his ear off only to leave again with a few of Micky's cassette tapes  in his pocket breaks through the static of contemplative self-isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's hope the EP comes together soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Micky and make MUKKE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/extras/085e1a9fb49d2ff29b834b358dffbf20.avif?t=1772533047\" width=610 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUKKE slaps. Not convinced yet? Just give it a try.<br>Do your thing and let your creativity lead the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>create and record\u00a0</strong>your own music by combining different sounds on your vinyl record</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>unlock </strong>new instruments and music tools that change the way you play</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>customize </strong>your  loop machine, the <i>vinyl player</i>, to embrace a look and feel that matches your music style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Get crackin'!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2579440?t=1772533047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/eb6350da537d8f15ade7afb90c45cdebd94e0db1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772533047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/a3224d7858d3abfd873e4d428dd47376eca21ebb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772533047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/a3224d7858d3abfd873e4d428dd47376eca21ebb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772533047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2892260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/extras/d6c94151bbd2005dc823bba06494a956.avif?t=1772533047\" width=610 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUKKE is a music tool for everyone, whether you're a music wiz or a complete novice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loop machine is kinda like the old keyboard in your grandparents' basement: go ham, strum around a bit, see what you can put together. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, maybe you're a natural! And if you're not, it's a fun ride anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/extras/9d895716166356c0b43f2bc1c0e2f775.avif?t=1772533047\" width=610 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mukke City, Potti district, 1978.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a year in obscurity, Micky Zander returns to the city and tries to find his feet again. He is determined to finally produce an EP. Within the four walls of his small Plattenbau flat, he cooks up some mean beats and does his best not to get distracted by the temptation of a nighttime club crawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the weird little guy who sometimes drops by and talks his ear off only to leave again with a few of Micky's cassette tapes  in his pocket breaks through the static of contemplative self-isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's hope the EP comes together soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Micky and make MUKKE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/extras/085e1a9fb49d2ff29b834b358dffbf20.avif?t=1772533047\" width=610 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MUKKE slaps. Not convinced yet? Just give it a try.<br>Do your thing and let your creativity lead the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>create and record\u00a0</strong>your own music by combining different sounds on your vinyl record</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>unlock </strong>new instruments and music tools that change the way you play</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>customize </strong>your  loop machine, the <i>vinyl player</i>, to embrace a look and feel that matches your music style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? Get crackin'!</p>","developers":["APETENSE Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2579440/5362aa84e7673161af25865894acdff999411bc4/header.jpg?t=1772533047","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2022-2024 APETENSE Interactive UG (haftungsbeschr\u00e4nkt)","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.13 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5 8th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 1050 ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2579440/1274687690/5996f9a0ec6a3b463f0c99888e0bb5d43bf36acc/1771800432/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771801795","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2579440/1274687690/5996f9a0ec6a3b463f0c99888e0bb5d43bf36acc/1771800432/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771801795","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2579440/1274687690/5996f9a0ec6a3b463f0c99888e0bb5d43bf36acc/1771800432/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771801795","id":257292434,"name":"MUKKE: Music Machine - SNF","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item